      236  ===Climate===
      237  [[File:Lima, Perú. Parque de Exposición.jpg|thumb|[[Parque de la Exposición]]]]
      238  Lima has a mild climate, despite its location in the tropics and in a [[desert]]. {{cite web |url=https://www.senamhi.gob.pe/?p=sinoptica |title=Análisis Meteorológico |language=Spanish |trans-title=Meteorological Analysis |publisher=Ministerio del Ambiente Peru |access-date=19 August 2021 }} Lima's
      239  The summers, December through April, are sunny, hot, and muggy. {{Cite web|url=https://www.nationalparks-worldwide.com/sam/peru/regions/coast/climate-coast.html|title=Climate on the Coast of Peru|website=www.nationalparks-worldwide.com|access-date=7 April 2023}} Daily temperatures oscillate between 
